| Group 9
| Cabrera, Niles
| Nellas, Aldrin
| Tibayan, Rafael

.include "beta.uasm"

| Initialization
LD(R31, ARRAY, R0)      | R0 = N (array length)
CMPLEC(R0, 1, R1)       | Check if N <= 1
BT(R1, DONE)            | If N <= 1, array is already sorted

OUTER_LOOP:
    CMOVE(0, R1)        | R1 = swapped flag (0 = false)
    CMOVE(ARRAY+4, R2)  | R2 = address of the first array element
    SUBC(R0, 1, R3)     | R3 = inner loop counter (N - 1)

INNER_LOOP:
    LD(R2, 0, R4)       | R4 = current element (ARRAY[i])
    LD(R2, 4, R5)       | R5 = next element (ARRAY[i+1])
    
    CMPLE(R4, R5, R6)   | R6 = 1 if ARRAY[i] <= ARRAY[i+1]
    BT(R6, SKIP_SWAP)   | If already in ascending order, skip the swap

    | Swap the elements
    ST(R5, 0, R2)       | ARRAY[i] = R5
    ST(R4, 4, R2)       | ARRAY[i+1] = R4
    CMOVE(1, R1)        | Set swapped flag to 1 (true)

SKIP_SWAP:
    ADDC(R2, 4, R2)     | Advance R2 to the next element address
    SUBC(R3, 1, R3)     | Decrement the inner loop counter
    BNE(R3, INNER_LOOP) | If counter != 0, repeat INNER_LOOP

    SUBC(R0, 1, R0)     | Optimization: The last checked element is now sorted, N--
    CMPLEC(R0, 1, R7)   | Check if remaining unsorted N <= 1
    BT(R7, DONE)        | If so, sorting is complete
    BNE(R1, OUTER_LOOP) | If a swap occurred (R1 == 1), repeat OUTER_LOOP

DONE:
    HALT()

. = 0x19C
ARRAY:
    LONG(7)             | Array length N
    LONG(5)
    LONG(7)
    LONG(8)
    LONG(6)
    LONG(4)
    LONG(9)
    LONG(3)